# Land of Sacred Serpents (ToAU 1, mission.toau.land_of_sacred_serpents). A fresh char's ToAU log has it current (set
# on character creation). A level 75 Warrior of Bastok with the Boarding Permit and the rival missions held (Burgeoning
# Dread, A Crystalline Prophecy Fin, A Rhapsody for the Ages, Abomination: their zone-ins stay out of the way) logs in
# in Aht Urhgan Whitegate south of Salaheem's Sentinels: area 3 (31 -7 -60 .. 39 -6 -52), the second platform: nothing
# outside it. Walked into: 3000 (text table 0), finished: completed, the Supplies Package given, Immortal Sentries
# current (nextMission). Again in the area: Immortal Sentries' section, not this mission's: nothing.
lists AhtUrhganWhitegate/onTriggerAreaEnter/3 AhtUrhganWhitegate/onEventFinish/3000
char zone=AhtUrhganWhitegate pos=34.7,-6.6,-40 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=1
mission Asa BurgeoningDread current
mission Acp ACrystallineProphecyFin current
mission Rov ARhapsodyForTheAges current
mission Soa Abomination current
keyitem BoardingPermit
login
tick 1000
tick 1000
tick 1000
walk 34.7,-6.6,-54.1                    # area 3: 3000
finish                                  # completed: the Supplies Package, Immortal Sentries current
walk 34.7,-6.6,-40
walk 34.7,-6.6,-54.1                    # no section for it: nothing
